  "texto": "<b>(SARESP)</b> As variáveis $x$ e $n$ assumem valores conforme tabela abaixo.<br><br><table style=\"margin: 10px auto; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #f87171;\"><tr style=\"background-color: #fee2e2; border-bottom: 1px solid #f87171;\"><th style=\"padding: 6px 14px; border-right: 1px solid #f87171;\">x</th><td style=\"padding: 6px 14px; border-right: 1px solid #f87171;\">2</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 14px; border-right: 1px solid #f87171;\">4</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 14px; border-right: 1px solid #f87171;\">6</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 14px; border-right: 1px solid #f87171;\">8</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 14px;\">10</td></tr><tr><th style=\"padding: 6px 14px; background-color: #fee2e2; border-right: 1px solid #f87171;\">n</th><td style=\"padding: 6px 14px; border-right: 1px solid #f87171;\">4</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 14px; border-right: 1px solid #f87171;\">8</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 14px; border-right: 1px solid #f87171;\">12</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 14px; border-right: 1px solid #f87171;\">16</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 14px;\">20</td></tr></table><br>A relação entre $x$ e $n$ é dada pela expressão",
